e of your branch. Make sure to communicate with your team and consider the implications before using the `--force` option.","turn_id":"turn_000003"},"target_developer_prompt":{"create_time":1686830411.965943,"event_index":2,"role":"user","source_node_id":"aaa2edb8-5cba-48a0-8e32-d6573a18fdf6","source_parent_id":"3e630d14-7b11-402b-a47f-611278fbcf04","source_record_index":2,"text":"i have git branch\ni make mistake when run git pull origin master\nbecause\nother team member make\n\ngit reset --hard eb03ab7090faa328380cfd82552fa67c42eac00a\ngit push --force origin  master\n\nnow i have wrong commits\nhow to rebase my commits after master  eb03ab7090faa328380cfd82552fa67c42eac00a?","turn_id":"turn_000002"}},"csv_extraction":{"context":[{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["i have git branch\ni make mistake when run git pull origin master"],"item_id":"context-1","normalized_text":"The user has a Git branch and mistakenly ran `git pull origin master`.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]},{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["other team member make\n\ngit reset --hard eb03ab7090faa328380cfd82552fa67c42eac00a\ngit push --force origin  master"],"item_id":"context-2","normalized_text":"Another team member reset `master` hard to commit `eb03ab7090faa328380cfd82552fa67c42eac00a` and force-pushed it to the remote.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]},{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["now i have wrong commits"],"item_id":"context-3","normalized_text":"The user's branch now contains unwanted commits.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]}],"specificity":[{"category":"specificity","evidence_spans":["how to rebase my commits after master  eb03ab7090faa328380cfd82552fa67c42eac00a?"],"item_id":"specificity-1","normalized_text":"The user wants to rebase their own commits after `master` at commit `eb03ab7090faa328380cfd82552fa67c42eac00a`.","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]}],"verifi